# This repository is authored on Windows and executed on Ubuntu 22.04.
#
# Without this file, Git's autocrlf would hand the Gate 2 auditor a checkout
# with CRLF line endings: broken shebangs, a Makefile that fails with opaque
# errors, and shell scripts that die on `\r`. Forcing LF everywhere makes the
# checkout identical on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.mp4    binary
*.gguf   binary
*.onnx   binary
*.bin    binary
*.pdf    binary
